      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "We do NOT run the step-ca server. We only use the step CLI as an offline tool to create\n1 root CA  +  2 leaf certs. Do this on the jumphost (or your laptop).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We do NOT run the step-ca server. We only use the step CLI as an offline tool to create\n1 root CA  +  2 leaf certs. Do this on the jumphost (or your laptop).",
