      "updated": 1789532412290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Then continue exactly like \"Session 2 continued\": import into ACM (body = leaf .crt, key = .key, chain = chain.pem)\n-> attach to ALB 443 listeners -> Route 53 records -> root_ca.crt into dashboard EC2 trust store + browser.\n\nstep vs openssl\n- step:    1 command per cert, SAN and extensions set automatically by --profile. Needs the step CLI installed.\n- openssl: already installed everywhere, but you must write the .ext files yourself (SAN, CA:TRUE/FALSE, keyUsage).\n           Forgetting subjectAltName is the #1 mistake -> browser says \"certificate is not valid for any names\".\n- Both give the same files, ACM / ALB / browser do not care which tool made them.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then continue exactly like \"Session 2 continued\": import into ACM (body = leaf .crt, key = .key, chain = chain.pem)\n-> attach to ALB 443 listeners -> Route 53 records -> root_ca.crt into dashboard EC2 trust store + browser.\n\nstep vs openssl\n- step:    1 command per cert, SAN and extensions set automatically by --profile. Needs the step CLI installed.\n- openssl: already installed everywhere, but you must write the .ext files yourself (SAN, CA:TRUE/FALSE, keyUsage).\n           Forgetting subjectAltName is the #1 mistake -> browser says \"certificate is not valid for any names\".\n- Both give the same files, ACM / ALB / browser do not care which tool made them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "u8eEZtqDjHuC-pOfdo93e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 5829.202406860459,
      "width": 1662.62109375,
      "height": 179.9458540213571,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 835024933,
      "version": 401,
      "versionNonce": 204431729,
      "index": "b0SAO",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789532412290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28.791336643417132,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "cat intermediate_ca.crt root_ca.crt > chain.pem            # order: intermediate first, then root\n\nstep certificate inspect dashboard.crt --short\nopenssl verify -CAfile root_ca.crt -untrusted intermediate_ca.crt dashboard.crt    # -> dashboard.crt: OK\nopenssl verify -CAfile root_ca.crt -untrusted intermediate_ca.crt counting.crt     # -> counting.crt: OK",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cat intermediate_ca.crt root_ca.crt > chain.pem            # order: intermediate first, then root\n\nstep certificate inspect dashboard.crt --short\nopenssl verify -CAfile root_ca.crt -untrusted intermediate_ca.crt dashboard.crt    # -> dashboard.crt: OK\nopenssl verify -CAfile root_ca.crt -untrusted intermediate_ca.crt counting.crt     # -> counting.crt: OK",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
