      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "What the browser sees when it opens https://dashboard.hellocloud.io :\n  ALB sends   dashboard.crt  +  intermediate_ca.crt   (from chain.pem in ACM)\n  browser has root_ca.crt in its trust store  ->  root signed intermediate, intermediate signed leaf  ->  padlock\nSame check happens inside the dashboard EC2 when it calls https://counting.hellocloud.io",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What the browser sees when it opens https://dashboard.hellocloud.io :\n  ALB sends   dashboard.crt  +  intermediate_ca.crt   (from chain.pem in ACM)\n  browser has root_ca.crt in its trust store  ->  root signed intermediate, intermediate signed leaf  ->  padlock\nSame check happens inside the dashboard EC2 when it calls https://counting.hellocloud.io",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
