      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "root_ca.crt          ->  laptop browser trust store, dashboard EC2 trust store   (only the ROOT is trusted)\nroot_ca.key          ->  offline / secret, not used again until the intermediate expires\nintermediate_ca.crt  ->  part of chain.pem\nintermediate_ca.key  ->  stays on jumphost (secret), signs new leaf certs\nchain.pem            ->  ACM \"Certificate chain\" field   (intermediate + root)\ndashboard.crt/key    ->  ACM import  ->  dashboard ALB 443 listener\ncounting.crt/key     ->  ACM import  ->  counting ALB 443 listener",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "root_ca.crt          ->  laptop browser trust store, dashboard EC2 trust store   (only the ROOT is trusted)\nroot_ca.key          ->  offline / secret, not used again until the intermediate expires\nintermediate_ca.crt  ->  part of chain.pem\nintermediate_ca.key  ->  stays on jumphost (secret), signs new leaf certs\nchain.pem            ->  ACM \"Certificate chain\" field   (intermediate + root)\ndashboard.crt/key    ->  ACM import  ->  dashboard ALB 443 listener\ncounting.crt/key     ->  ACM import  ->  counting ALB 443 listener",
