      "updated": 1789532412290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "AWS console -> Certificate Manager -> Import certificate\n  Certificate body    = dashboard.crt   (leaf only)\n  Certificate private key = dashboard-plain.key\n  Certificate chain   = chain.pem       (intermediate + root)\nRepeat for counting.hellocloud.io.\n\n# CLI\naws acm import-certificate --region ap-southeast-1 \\\n  --certificate fileb://dashboard.crt --private-key fileb://dashboard-plain.key --certificate-chain fileb://chain.pem\naws acm import-certificate --region ap-southeast-1 \\\n  --certificate fileb://counting.crt  --private-key fileb://counting-plain.key  --certificate-chain fileb://chain.pem\naws acm list-certificates --region ap-southeast-1\n\nNotes: ACM does NOT auto-renew imported certs -> re-import before expiry (step ca renew, then import again).\n       Private CA in ACM is disabled here; only public CA or import is allowed -> that is why we import.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS console -> Certificate Manager -> Import certificate\n  Certificate body    = dashboard.crt   (leaf only)\n  Certificate private key = dashboard-plain.key\n  Certificate chain   = chain.pem       (intermediate + root)\nRepeat for counting.hellocloud.io.\n\n# CLI\naws acm import-certificate --region ap-southeast-1 \\\n  --certificate fileb://dashboard.crt --private-key fileb://dashboard-plain.key --certificate-chain fileb://chain.pem\naws acm import-certificate --region ap-southeast-1 \\\n  --certificate fileb://counting.crt  --private-key fileb://counting-plain.key  --certificate-chain fileb://chain.pem\naws acm list-certificates --region ap-southeast-1\n\nNotes: ACM does NOT auto-renew imported certs -> re-import before expiry (step ca renew, then import again).\n       Private CA in ACM is disabled here; only public CA or import is allowed -> that is why we import.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
