      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Dashboard ALB (internet-facing)\n  Listeners -> Add listener -> HTTPS : 443\n  Default action: forward -> dashboard-tg (HTTP 9002)\n  Default SSL cert: from ACM -> dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  (optional) HTTP:80 listener -> redirect to HTTPS 443\n  Security group (ALB): inbound 443 from 0.0.0.0/0\n\nCounting ALB (internal)\n  Listeners -> Add listener -> HTTPS : 443\n  Default action: forward -> counting-tg (HTTP 9003)\n  Default SSL cert: from ACM -> counting.hellocloud.io\n  Security group (ALB): inbound 443 from dashboard EC2 SG only\n\nTarget group health check: HTTP on 9002 / 9003 (unchanged, TLS terminates at the ALB)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dashboard ALB (internet-facing)\n  Listeners -> Add listener -> HTTPS : 443\n  Default action: forward -> dashboard-tg (HTTP 9002)\n  Default SSL cert: from ACM -> dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  (optional) HTTP:80 listener -> redirect to HTTPS 443\n  Security group (ALB): inbound 443 from 0.0.0.0/0\n\nCounting ALB (internal)\n  Listeners -> Add listener -> HTTPS : 443\n  Default action: forward -> counting-tg (HTTP 9003)\n  Default SSL cert: from ACM -> counting.hellocloud.io\n  Security group (ALB): inbound 443 from dashboard EC2 SG only\n\nTarget group health check: HTTP on 9002 / 9003 (unchanged, TLS terminates at the ALB)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
