      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Route 53 -> Hosted zones -> Create\n  Domain: hellocloud.io   Type: Private   Associate VPC: dashboard-counting-vpc (ap-southeast-1)\nCreate records (simple routing, Alias = yes):\n  dashboard.hellocloud.io  A  -> Alias to Application Load Balancer -> dashboard ALB\n  counting.hellocloud.io   A  -> Alias to Application Load Balancer -> internal counting ALB\nCheck from an EC2 in the VPC:\n  nslookup dashboard.hellocloud.io ; nslookup counting.hellocloud.io\nPrivate zone only works inside the VPC (VPC DNS must be enabled: enableDnsSupport + enableDnsHostnames).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Route 53 -> Hosted zones -> Create\n  Domain: hellocloud.io   Type: Private   Associate VPC: dashboard-counting-vpc (ap-southeast-1)\nCreate records (simple routing, Alias = yes):\n  dashboard.hellocloud.io  A  -> Alias to Application Load Balancer -> dashboard ALB\n  counting.hellocloud.io   A  -> Alias to Application Load Balancer -> internal counting ALB\nCheck from an EC2 in the VPC:\n  nslookup dashboard.hellocloud.io ; nslookup counting.hellocloud.io\nPrivate zone only works inside the VPC (VPC DNS must be enabled: enableDnsSupport + enableDnsHostnames).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
