      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789532412290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "sudo vi /etc/hosts        (private zone is not resolvable from outside)\n  <dashboard ALB public IP 1>  dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  <dashboard ALB public IP 2>  dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  (get IPs: nslookup dashboard-alb-xxxx.ap-southeast-1.elb.amazonaws.com)\n\ncurl --cacert root_ca.crt https://dashboard.hellocloud.io\nBrowser: shows Not Secure until root_ca.crt is trusted\n  Chrome/Edge: settings -> Privacy and security -> Security -> Manage certificates -> Trusted Root -> Import root_ca.crt\n  macOS: Keychain Access -> System -> import root_ca.crt -> Always Trust\n  Firefox: Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Certificates -> View -> Authorities -> Import\n  or:  step certificate install root_ca.crt\nReload https://dashboard.hellocloud.io -> padlock OK -> dashboard calls counting over https internally",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sudo vi /etc/hosts        (private zone is not resolvable from outside)\n  <dashboard ALB public IP 1>  dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  <dashboard ALB public IP 2>  dashboard.hellocloud.io\n  (get IPs: nslookup dashboard-alb-xxxx.ap-southeast-1.elb.amazonaws.com)\n\ncurl --cacert root_ca.crt https://dashboard.hellocloud.io\nBrowser: shows Not Secure until root_ca.crt is trusted\n  Chrome/Edge: settings -> Privacy and security -> Security -> Manage certificates -> Trusted Root -> Import root_ca.crt\n  macOS: Keychain Access -> System -> import root_ca.crt -> Always Trust\n  Firefox: Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Certificates -> View -> Authorities -> Import\n  or:  step certificate install root_ca.crt\nReload https://dashboard.hellocloud.io -> padlock OK -> dashboard calls counting over https internally",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
