      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789292568494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Traffic flow\n1. Browser  ->  https://dashboard.hellocloud.io:443 (internet-facing ALB, cert issued by step-ca, browser trusts root_ca.crt)\n2. Dashboard ALB  ->  dashboard EC2 :9002\n3. Dashboard app  ->  https://counting.hellocloud.io:443 (Route 53 private zone -> internal ALB, verified with root_ca.crt in VM trust store)\n4. Counting ALB  ->  counting EC2 :9003",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traffic flow\n1. Browser  ->  https://dashboard.hellocloud.io:443 (internet-facing ALB, cert issued by step-ca, browser trusts root_ca.crt)\n2. Dashboard ALB  ->  dashboard EC2 :9002\n3. Dashboard app  ->  https://counting.hellocloud.io:443 (Route 53 private zone -> internal ALB, verified with root_ca.crt in VM trust store)\n4. Counting ALB  ->  counting EC2 :9003",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wy608pWLCoPfyt2jRIoMB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -523.1334043889594,
      "y": 3427.6792540416614,
      "width": 2516.79833984375,
      "height": 682.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 719539123,
      "version": 285,
      "versionNonce": 2024867442,
      "index": "b18",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789294589346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Steps (Smallstep version)\n\n1. Route 53: create private hosted zone hellocloud.io, associate VPC\n     A record dashboard -> internet-facing dashboard ALB\n     A record counting  -> internal counting ALB\n2. nslookup dashboard.hellocloud.io / counting.hellocloud.io from an EC2 in the VPC\n3. Install step CLI on the step-ca EC2 (or jumphost)\n     wget https://dl.smallstep.com/gh-release/cli/gh-release-header/v0.30.0/step-cli_0.30.0-1_amd64.deb\n     step certificate create \"hellocloud.io Root CA\" root_ca.crt root_ca.key --profile root-ca --no-password --insecure\n4. Issue leaf certs from the root\n     step certificate create dashboard.hellocloud.io dashboard.crt dashboard.key --profile leaf --ca root_ca.crt --ca-key root_ca.key --not-after 8760h --no-password --insecure\n     step certificate create counting.hellocloud.io  counting.crt  counting.key  --profile leaf --ca root_ca.crt --ca-key root_ca.key --not-after 8760h --no-password --insecure\n5. ACM -> Import certificate (per domain): body = leaf .crt, private key = .key, chain = root_ca.crt\n6. ALB listeners: add HTTPS:443 with the imported cert; security groups allow 443 inbound\n     (dashboard ALB SG from 0.0.0.0/0, counting ALB SG from dashboard EC2 SG)\n7. Dashboard EC2: copy root_ca.crt to /etc/pki/ca-trust/source/anchors/, update-ca-trust extract\n     set COUNTING_UPSTREAM_URL=https://counting.hellocloud.io, restart dashboard-service\n8. Laptop: /etc/hosts -> <ALB public IP> dashboard.hellocloud.io\n     import root_ca.crt into browser / OS trusted root store\n9. Test https://dashboard.hellocloud.io (padlock ok) -> dashboard calls counting over https internally\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps (Smallstep version)\n\n1. Route 53: create private hosted zone hellocloud.io, associate VPC\n     A record dashboard -> internet-facing dashboard ALB\n     A record counting  -> internal counting ALB\n2. nslookup dashboard.hellocloud.io / counting.hellocloud.io from an EC2 in the VPC\n3. Install step CLI on the step-ca EC2 (or jumphost)\n     wget https://dl.smallstep.com/gh-release/cli/gh-release-header/v0.30.0/step-cli_0.30.0-1_amd64.deb\n     step certificate create \"hellocloud.io Root CA\" root_ca.crt root_ca.key --profile root-ca --no-password --insecure\n4. Issue leaf certs from the root\n     step certificate create dashboard.hellocloud.io dashboard.crt dashboard.key --profile leaf --ca root_ca.crt --ca-key root_ca.key --not-after 8760h --no-password --insecure\n     step certificate create counting.hellocloud.io  counting.crt  counting.key  --profile leaf --ca root_ca.crt --ca-key root_ca.key --not-after 8760h --no-password --insecure\n5. ACM -> Import certificate (per domain): body = leaf .crt, private key = .key, chain = root_ca.crt\n6. ALB listeners: add HTTPS:443 with the imported cert; security groups allow 443 inbound\n     (dashboard ALB SG from 0.0.0.0/0, counting ALB SG from dashboard EC2 SG)\n7. Dashboard EC2: copy root_ca.crt to /etc/pki/ca-trust/source/anchors/, update-ca-trust extract\n     set COUNTING_UPSTREAM_URL=https://counting.hellocloud.io, restart dashboard-service\n8. Laptop: /etc/hosts -> <ALB public IP> dashboard.hellocloud.io\n     import root_ca.crt into browser / OS trusted root store\n9. Test https://dashboard.hellocloud.io (padlock ok) -> dashboard calls counting over https internally\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zVjKlHXibb_48Oft_R5D_",
