      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "- Can use AWS Certificate Manager as well, but in this account Private CA is disabled -> only public CA allowed.\n  Public CA needs a valid registered domain + public hosted zone (DNS validation).\n- That is why today we switched to Smallstep: we make our own root CA and import the certs into ACM.\n- AWS Private CA costs ~USD 400 / month per CA (general-purpose) or ~USD 50 / month (short-lived cert mode). Delete it after the lab.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Can use AWS Certificate Manager as well, but in this account Private CA is disabled -> only public CA allowed.\n  Public CA needs a valid registered domain + public hosted zone (DNS validation).\n- That is why today we switched to Smallstep: we make our own root CA and import the certs into ACM.\n- AWS Private CA costs ~USD 400 / month per CA (general-purpose) or ~USD 50 / month (short-lived cert mode). Delete it after the lab.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
