      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Session 1 - AWS Private CA + ACM\n\nCA lives in AWS (PCA)\nACM requests + renews certs automatically\nNo key files to handle\nRoot cert: download from PCA console\nCost: PCA is paid per month\nBlocked if account disables Private CA",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "oXOPU8s8f2RDzts_o0Cc_",
      "originalText": "Session 1 - AWS Private CA + ACM\n\nCA lives in AWS (PCA)\nACM requests + renews certs automatically\nNo key files to handle\nRoot cert: download from PCA console\nCost: PCA is paid per month\nBlocked if account disables Private CA",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
