      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Session 2 - Smallstep step CLI + ACM import\n\nCA lives on the jumphost (root_ca.crt / .key)\nYou create certs with step, then IMPORT into ACM\nYou handle key files + renewals yourself\nRoot cert: root_ca.crt you created\nCost: free\nWorks in any account",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mnkVyABc3-Cxn0Wheh5e7",
      "originalText": "Session 2 - Smallstep step CLI + ACM import\n\nCA lives on the jumphost (root_ca.crt / .key)\nYou create certs with step, then IMPORT into ACM\nYou handle key files + renewals yourself\nRoot cert: root_ca.crt you created\nCost: free\nWorks in any account",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aKC4IJrYS8zJQLbaUDl4Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5724.562704935604,
      "y": 426.1738140713112,
      "width": 991.3860000000003,
      "height": 137.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
