      "updated": 1789291009912,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Same in both:\n  Route 53 private hosted zone -> ALB alias records\n  ALB HTTPS 443 listener uses a cert that is in ACM\n  Browser must trust the root CA (import)\n  Dashboard EC2 must trust the root CA (update-ca-trust) to call https://counting.hellocloud.io",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Same in both:\n  Route 53 private hosted zone -> ALB alias records\n  ALB HTTPS 443 listener uses a cert that is in ACM\n  Browser must trust the root CA (import)\n  Dashboard EC2 must trust the root CA (update-ca-trust) to call https://counting.hellocloud.io",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
